      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 7.835000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331467.9561555,
      "text": "Scripted tool calls：脚本模式下模拟的工具调用（JSON），工具本身仍会真实执行",
      "chapter": "editor",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 5.555000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331477.0376575,
      "text": "Condition 节点。Left：要判断的值，这里是 Reviewer 的输出",
      "chapter": "editor",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.7
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331482.1817112,
      "text": "Operator：contains、not_contains、equals、not_equals、greater_than、less_than、is_true",
      "chapter": "editor",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 8.405
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331491.1504931,
      "text": "Right：比较的对象；这里判断“Reviewer 的输出是否包含 REVISE”",
      "chapter": "editor",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.795
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331496.4154062,
      "text": "Max true visits = 2：循环保护，条件第 3 次为 true 时强制走 false，避免死循环",
      "chapter": "editor",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 6.125
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331504.2498467,
      "text": "Output 节点。Template：用模板拼出最终结果，可以引用输入和任意节点的输出",
      "chapter": "editor",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.985
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331511.8500433,
      "text": "运行输入：字段来自 Start 节点的定义，可以在这里修改本次运行的值",
      "chapter": "run",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.2250000000000005
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331517.4670038,
      "text": "提供者有三个选项：As configured（按工作流设置）、Real model（需要 API key，当前不可选）、Deterministic（脚本回答，离线）。这里选 Deterministic",
      "chapter": "run",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 10.4
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331528.315668,
      "text": "Breakpoints：勾选的节点在执行前暂停，之后可以在运行页或编辑器里 Resume",
      "chapter": "run",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 5.08
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331534.5721762,
      "text": "这次在 Final brief 前设一个断点",
      "chapter": "run",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 2.9899999999999998
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331538.0417116,
      "text": "Start run：如果有未保存的改动会先保存，然后开始运行",
      "chapter": "run",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 3.75
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331543.9342368,
      "text": "底部运行条：这个工作流的运行记录。点选一条，画布就叠加显示那次运行的节点状态；open 打开运行详情",
