      "dur": 7.930000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331565.297115,
      "text": "Final brief 显示 paused：停在断点前，还没有执行",
      "chapter": "run",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.035
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331570.1468766,
      "text": "运行暂停时，编辑器顶部会出现 Resume；运行失败时这里会变成 Retry from failure",
      "chapter": "run",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.745
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331578.9810586,
      "text": "选中一次运行后，检查器底部显示该节点最近一次执行的状态、输入、输出和子调用",
      "chapter": "run",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.415
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331586.2965672,
      "text": "面包屑：这次运行属于 Runs 列表中的哪个工作流",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.275
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331590.029674,
      "text": "标题和当前状态：paused（暂停）",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 2.61
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331593.483186,
      "text": "运行 ID：在 Compare 中可以粘贴它来对比任意两次运行",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.8449999999999998
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331597.8293862,
      "text": "deterministic script：这次运行的智能体使用脚本回答，不是模型输出；真实模型运行显示 real model",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 6.79
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331605.077379,
      "text": "definition v1：运行时保存的定义快照，之后修改工作流不影响这次运行",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.605
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331610.5289316,
      "text": "Capabilities：这次运行支持的操作——执行、检查点、暂停/恢复、分叉、重放、失败重试；✕ 表示不支持",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 6.125
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331617.162114,
      "text": "Resume：从断点处的检查点继续执行",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 2.705
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331620.7536855,
      "text": "恢复后运行完成：Final brief 已执行",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 2.0
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331624.5819385,
      "text": "Graph：工作流结构图叠加本次运行的节点状态",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 3.085
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331628.1966286,
      "text": "图例：×N 是循环中的执行次数，变淡表示没有执行，inherited 表示分支从父运行继承了该节点的结果",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 5.840000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331635.4729729,
      "text": "点击图中的节点，会跳到 Spans 并选中这个节点最近一次的 span",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.2
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331640.3455095,
      "text": "Timeline：表头给出总时长；每一行是一个 span",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.56
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331644.3840947,
      "text": "左边：类型标签和名称，按父子关系缩进；中间横条：开始时间和持续时间；右边：耗时。点击行可跳到 Span 详情",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 6.03
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331652.0659034,
      "text": "Spans：按名称或智能体过滤",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 2.325
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331654.885889,
      "text": "按类型过滤：workflow、agent、llm、tool、condition、output、pause",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.840000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331661.2174613,
      "text": "按状态过滤：ok、error、running、paused、resumed",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.415
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331666.7960086,
      "text": "例如只看 pause：这条就是刚才在 Final brief 前的断点暂停",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.415
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331673.646564,
      "text": "Span 详情：所属节点、Span id、父 span、起止时间、耗时、提供者和模型、对应的检查点、子调用",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.9350000000000005
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331680.186045,
      "text": "LLM span 会列出发给模型的完整消息：system、user，以及工具结果",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 4.7
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331685.4010108,
      "text": "Output：模型的回复（这里是脚本回答）",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 2.895
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331689.570959,
      "text": "Attributes：原始属性，比如提供者、模型、token 用量",
      "chapter": "detail",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 4.035
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331696.1851397,
      "text": "检查点列表：LangGraph 在每个节点执行后写入一个检查点。每行是：#序号、在哪个节点之后、下一步执行什么",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 6.125
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331703.0122185,
      "text": "forkable：可以从这里分叉；parent 表示继承自父运行；paused 表示停在这里",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.2700000000000005
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331710.2930171,
      "text": "选中第一次 Reviewer 之后的检查点（当时的结论是 REVISE）",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.32
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331715.192966,
      "text": "Replay from here：用完全相同的状态在新分支里继续执行",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.13
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331720.0918047,
      "text": "Fork with edits：先修改状态，再在新分支里继续执行",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.94
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331724.6729634,
      "text": "分叉和重放都会创建新运行（新 thread），原运行和它的历史不会被修改",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.32
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331729.507413,
      "text": "这个检查点的完整状态：已执行的路径、输入，以及每个节点当时的输出",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 3.94
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331734.9655938,
      "text": "分叉对话框：可以修改输入和各节点的输出；没改的字段保持检查点里的值；条件会按新值重新计算",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.08
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331742.2967312,
      "text": "把 Reviewer 的输出改成 APPROVED",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 3.275
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331746.0684314,
      "text": "Create branch and run：创建分支并立即运行",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 3.8449999999999998
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331752.4006135,
      "text": "分支关系：fork of 源运行 · 来自哪个检查点 · 修改了哪个字段",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.32
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331758.1082616,
      "text": "检查点之前的节点标记为 inherited：直接继承，没有重新执行",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.035
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331762.838333,
      "text": "条件按新值重新判断：不再包含 REVISE，走 false，只执行一次",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.2250000000000005
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331769.245622,
      "text": "直接进入 Final brief：这条分支跳过了后面两轮修改",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.75
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331774.63808,
      "text": "Compare with：默认选中父运行或子分支，也可以粘贴任意运行 ID 后按回车",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.890000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331780.0224264,
      "text": "两次运行实际走过的路径：分支只执行了检查点之后的节点",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.37
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331783.9298441,
      "text": "逐节点对比输出：inherited 是继承的，differs 是结果不同，same 是相同",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 5.175000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331790.740598,
      "text": "Run input/output：本次运行的输入、最终输出和错误信息",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.13
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331796.839464,
      "text": "回到源运行：这里列出了它的所有分支，源运行本身没有变化",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.465
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331803.9215949,
      "text": "重放：从这个检查点用相同的状态继续执行。确定性节点会得到相同结果，调用模型的节点会重新调用",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.175000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331812.3866177,
      "text": "重放结果与源运行对比：final 为 same——脚本化节点重放后结果相同",
      "chapter": "fork",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 4.415
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331818.5413454,
      "text": "新建的工作流自带 Start → Assistant → Answer 三个节点",
      "chapter": "build",
