      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.460000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792331960.7560608,
      "text": "Agent type：本项目原有的 M1 执行系统，或者任何用 studio-executor SDK 包装的 LangGraph 智能体",
