    {
      "t": 1792331999.5143807,
      "text": "新连接器：offline（还没启动）、started by the Studio（由 Studio 启动）；右侧可以删除，已镜像的运行会保留",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 7.550000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332007.5829868,
      "text": "Start executor：启动执行器进程",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 2.9899999999999998
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332013.6771133,
      "text": "地址、进程号、进程状态，以及已有多少次运行镜像到 Studio",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.8449999999999998
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332017.9824338,
      "text": "Graph：节点列表来自执行器自己的 LangGraph 图，不是 Studio 猜的",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.985
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332023.4166203,
      "text": "Capabilities：执行器支持的操作；fork may edit：分叉时允许修改的状态字段（plan、worker_instruction）",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 7.835000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332031.8433557,
      "text": "执行器自己声明的说明，例如暂停只在 pause_gate 生效",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.8449999999999998
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332036.190844,
      "text": "输入字段也由执行器声明：Task 和可选的 Allowed files",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.2250000000000005
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332043.1336794,
      "text": "Browse the executor's own runs：浏览执行器自己的运行记录，可以导入到 Studio",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 6.220000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332051.9105945,
      "text": "connected executor：运行发生在执行器进程里；旁边是执行器自己的运行 ID",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.175000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332058.195251,
      "text": "离线模式下，任务中提到 code 就交给 Coder 执行",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 3.655
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332062.4642136,
      "text": "WebSurfer 显示 not run：这次没有走到这个节点",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.8449999999999998
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332068.3664258,
      "text": "m1.* span 是执行器自己通过 OTLP 上报的，按运行 ID 自动挂到这次运行下",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.08
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332077.0328279,
      "text": "第二个连接器：一个独立编写的 LangGraph 客服智能体，用 studio-executor SDK 包装",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 6.125
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332083.7779162,
      "text": "智能体由你自己启动，启动时会打印地址和 token；包装自己的图只需要几行代码",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.605
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332093.017241,
      "text": "Token：每个请求都要带上；它保存在 Studio 数据库里，之后不再显示",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 4.51
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332098.8915055,
      "text": "连接成功：SDK agent，deterministic script（智能体自己报告使用的模型类型）",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 5.745
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332105.1385827,
      "text": "可分叉修改的字段由智能体声明：category、facts、draft、review",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 4.890000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332115.724614,
      "text": "Studio 从智能体的检查点重建图：draft 和 review 循环了 2 次；虚线是条件路由",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 5.555000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332124.4114337,
      "text": "检查点直接从智能体自己的存储读取；分叉和重放由智能体在原 thread 中创建新分支",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.890000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332129.8386588,
      "text": "这里只显示智能体声明为可编辑的字段；完整状态在下方 Full executor state 中",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.365
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332138.3400292,
      "text": "把第一次审核的结论从 REVISE 改成 APPROVED；智能体会再校验一次",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 4.605
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332146.3286455,
      "text": "Compare：classify、lookup 继承；跳过第二轮修改后，finalize 的最终回答不同",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 5.840000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332153.2978654,
      "text": "Runs on connected executors：所有接入智能体的运行，Lineage 列显示分支关系",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 6.03
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332160.1918528,
      "text": "Stop executor：停止由 Studio 启动的执行器进程",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.035
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332166.0090916,
      "text": "执行器离线后，Studio 仍显示上次同步的历史；此时控制操作会返回错误",
      "chapter": "connected",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.32
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332171.4202838,
      "text": "Integrations：这里的智能体只上报轨迹（只读）；能暴露检查点的 LangGraph 智能体请用 Connected agents",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 7.455
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332179.6575654,
      "text": "示例外部智能体：executable 表示可以从这里启动；trace-only control 表示 Studio 只能看，不能控制",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 7.170000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332187.3726106,
      "text": "它是独立的 Python 程序（Analyst → Critic），不是 LangGraph，只用 OpenTelemetry 埋点",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 7.170000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332195.073824,
      "text": "启动参数。Topic：研究主题",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 2.325
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332197.8737977,
      "text": "Mode：deterministic（离线脚本）或 openai（真实模型）",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.51
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332202.8899226,
      "text": "Simulate tool failure：设为 true 时让 word_count 工具故意报错，用来演示错误捕获",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 6.505000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332211.2712483,
      "text": "启动后显示进程状态、pid 和退出码；轨迹到达后出现 Open trace",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.415
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332217.5536842,
      "text": "trace-only (read-only)：Studio 和这个进程之间没有控制通道",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.985
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332223.3369968,
      "text": "所以所有能力都是 ✕：不能暂停、分叉或重放",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 2.895
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332227.0546494,
      "text": "Checkpoints & fork 标签不可用：外部轨迹没有检查点",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.13
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332232.1555946,
      "text": "图是按 span 的父子关系画出的调用树，不是工作流结构；任何框架只要发 span 都能得到",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 5.2700000000000005
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332240.3892415,
      "text": "span 的类型和内容来自 OpenInference 属性：span.kind、input.value、output.value 等",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 7.265000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332250.3764932,
      "text": "再启动一次，这次设为 true",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 2.325
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332255.6370277,
      "text": "失败轨迹：span 的错误状态和 exception 事件被识别为失败，并保留堆栈",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.795
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332261.1854625,
      "text": "word_count 标红；工具抛出异常后程序退出，Critic 没有执行，所以图里没有它",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 5.175000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332267.7020757,
      "text": "OTLP 接收地址：任何框架把 OpenTelemetry 导出器指向这里即可",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 4.605
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332272.8852427,
      "text": "Python 示例代码，或设置环境变量 OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_TRACES_ENDPOINT；下方列出能识别的属性",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "top",
      "dur": 7.075
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332282.6681573,
      "text": "External traces：所有外部轨迹，标注 trace-only；上方可以按名称搜索、按状态筛选",
      "chapter": "external",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.840000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332291.5696099,
      "text": "Runs 只列出 Studio 工作流的运行，包括分叉和重放；外部智能体的运行在 Connected agents，外部轨迹在 External traces",
      "chapter": "runs",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 8.405
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332300.4803786,
      "text": "按工作流名称或运行 ID 搜索",
      "chapter": "runs",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 2.325
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332303.9564228,
      "text": "按状态筛选：例如只看 failed，就是刚才 1/0 的那次运行",
      "chapter": "runs",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.94
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332309.0526876,
      "text": "Kind：智能体用的提供者——deterministic script、real model；没有 Agent 节点的工作流显示 no-llm。分支会标出 fork of / replay of",
      "chapter": "runs",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 10.115
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332319.9004593,
      "text": "Duration、Spans、Error：耗时、span 数量，以及失败时的出错节点和原因",
      "chapter": "runs",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": false,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 5.175000000000001
    },
    {
      "t": 1792332325.7402048,
      "text": "带 fork of 标签的是分支运行；点击任意一行打开运行详情",
      "chapter": "runs",
      "kind": "info",
      "highlight": true,
      "pos": "bottom",
      "dur": 3.8449999999999998
    }
